    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu Wuu Iman Doonaa Wuuna Xukumi Doonaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eeg, waxaa imanaysa maalintii Rabbiga ee waxaagii la dhacay dhexdaada lagu qaybsan doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, quruumaha oo dhan waan u soo wada ururin doonaa inay Yeruusaalem la diriraan, oo magaalada waa la qabsan doonaa, guryahana waa la dhici doonaa, naagahana waa la kufsan doonaa, oo magaalada badhkeedna maxaabiis ahaan baa loo kaxaysan doonaa, laakiinse dadka intiisii hadhay magaalada lagama baabbi'in doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Rabbigu soo bixi doonaa, oo quruumahaas buu la diriri doonaa, siduu u diriray maalintii dagaalka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalintaas cagihiisu waxay ku istaagi doonaan Buur Saytuun, taasoo Yeruusaalem ka horraysa oo xagga bari ka xigta, oo Buur Saytuunna dhexday uga kala dillaaci doontaa xagga bari iyo xagga galbeed, oo waxaa jiri doonta dooxo aad u weyn, oo buurta badhkeed wuxuu u durki doonaa xagga woqooyi, oo badhkeeda kalena wuxuu u durki doonaa xagga koonfureed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaad ku carari doontaan dooxadii buurahayga, waayo, dooxada buuruhu waxay gaadhi doontaa tan iyo Aaseel. Oo waxaad u carari doontaan sidaad ugu hor cararteen dhulgariirkii dhacay wakhtigii Cusiyaah boqorka ka ahaa dalka Yahuudah. Oo Rabbiga Ilaahayga ahu wuu iman doonaa, oo waxaa la iman doonaa kuwa quduuska ah oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay maalintaas noqon doontaa in iftiinku uusan yeelanayn dhalaal iyo gudcur toona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laakiinse waxay ahaan doontaa maalin uu Rabbigu og yahay, taasoo aan maalin ahayn, oo aan habeenna ahayn, laakiinse waxay ahaan doontaa in markay fiidkii tahay uu iftiin jiri doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay maalintaas noqon doontaa inay biyo noolu Yeruusaalem ka soo baxaan, oo badhkood wuxuu u qulquli doonaa xagga badda bari, oo badhkooda kalena wuxuu u qulquli doonaa xagga badda galbeed, oo waxay ahaan doontaa wakhtiga kulaylka iyo wakhtiga qabowga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu boqor buu ka ahaan doonaa dunida oo dhan, oo maalintaas Rabbigu mid buu ahaan doonaa, oo magiciisuna mid buu ahaan doonaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dalka oo dhammuna wuxuu u rogman doonaa sida Caraabaah, tan iyo Gebac iyo ilaa Rimmoon oo Yeruusaalem xagga koonfureed ka jirta. Oo Yeruusaalemna kor baa loo qaadi doonaa oo waxay iska degganaan doontaa meesheeda, tan iyo iridda Benyaamiin iyo ilaa meesha iridda kowaad, iyo ilaa iridda geeska ku taal, iyo tan iyo munaaradda Xananeel iyo ilaa boqorka macsarooyinkiisa khamriga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dad baa dhexdeeda degganaan doona, oo innaba habaar dambe ma jiri doono, laakiinse Yeruusaalem si ammaan ah ayay u degganaan doontaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo tanuna waa belaayada Rabbigu ku dhufan doono dadyowga Yeruusaalem la diriray oo dhan. Iyagoo cagahooda ku taagan ayaa hilibkoodu iska dhammaan doona, oo indhahoodu waxay ku dhex baabbi'i doonaan godadkooda, carrabkooduna afkooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wakhtigaas rabshad weyn oo xagga Rabbiga ka timid ayaa dhexdooda jiri doonta, oo midkood kastaaba wuxuu qabsan doonaa gacanta deriskiisa, oo gacantiisu waxay ku kici doontaa gacanta deriskiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba dadka dalka Yahuudah Yeruusaalem bay ku dagaallami doonaan, oo maalka quruumaha hareeraheeda ku wareegsan oo dhanna waa la soo wada ururin doonaa, kaasoo ah dahab iyo lacag iyo dhar aad u badan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo saasay noqon doontaa belaayada faraska, iyo tan baqalka, iyo tan awrka, iyo tan dameerka, oo xayawaanka xerooyinkaas jooga oo dhanba waxaa ku dhici doonta belaayadan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxay noqon doontaa in mid kasta oo ka hadhay quruumihii Yeruusaalem ku soo kacay oo dhan uu u kici doono inuu soo caabudo Boqorka ah Rabbiga ciidammada, iyo inuu soo dhawro Iiddii Waababka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo qolooyinka dhulka deggan oo dhan ku alla kii aan Yeruusaalem ugu kicin inuu soo caabudo Boqorka ah Rabbiga ciidammada innaba roob kuma di'i doono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddii uusan reer Masar u kicin, oo uusan iman, iyagana roob kuma di'i doono, oo waxaa jiri doonta belaayo taasoo Rabbigu ku dhufan doono quruumihii aan u kicin inay soo dhawraan Iiddii Waababka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taasu waxay ahaan doontaa ciqaabta Masar, iyo ciqaabta dhammaan quruumaha aan u kicin inay soo dhawraan Iiddii Waababka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakhtigaas dawannada fardaha waxaa ku qornaan doona, WAA U QUDUUS RABBIGA, oo dheryaha guriga Rabbiga ku jiraana waxay ahaan doonaan sida maddiibadaha meesha allabariga hor yaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo xataa dheri kasta oo Yeruusaalem dhex yaal iyo mid kasta oo dalka Yahuudah dhex yaalba quduus buu u ahaan doonaa Rabbiga ciidammada, oo kuwa allabariga bixiya oo dhammu way iman doonaan oo intay qaataan ayay wax ku karsan doonaan, oo wakhtigaas ka dib mid reer Kancaan ahu guriga Rabbiga ciidammada kuma jiri doono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
